This directory contains test fixtures for Xcode integration.

Each of the files is based on the JSON output generated by
`xcrun devicectl list devices --json-output -`. Identifying details have
been anonymized.

`multiple-devices.json` uses the device layout of Xcode 26. Additional devices
have been derived from a real device to represent devices that are unpaired,
don't have Developer Mode enabled, can't be reached, are on a different
platform, or are simulated.

`properties-layout.json` uses the `properties` dictionary that Xcode 27
introduced to replace the `hardwareProperties`, `deviceProperties` and
`connectionProperties` dictionaries. It was constructed from descriptions of
that layout, rather than captured from a real device.
